# Conjecture ledger

What this project currently believes, how strongly, and what to test next. One file per
conjecture (`CNNN-slug.md`, format in [TEMPLATE.md](TEMPLATE.md)); this page is the list.
Every conjecture serves at least one research question
([../questions/_index.md](../questions/_index.md)). Reasoning behind the rules:
[docs/discipline/conjecture-ledger.md](../../docs/discipline/conjecture-ledger.md).
